@startuml sequence_read
!theme plain
autonumber

title Диаграмма последовательности: READ - Получение списка клиентов (п.1)

actor Пользователь as User
participant "HTML/JS\n(View)" as View
participant "FastAPI\n(App)" as FastAPI
participant "MainController\n(Controller)" as Controller
participant "RepositoryObserver\n(Subject)" as Observer
participant "ClientDBAdapter\n(Repository)" as Adapter
participant "Client_rep_DB\n(Model)" as DB
database "PostgreSQL" as Database

User -> View: Открывает страницу\n/загружает данные
activate View

View -> FastAPI: GET /api/clients\n?page=1&page_size=10
activate FastAPI

FastAPI -> Controller: get_clients_page(page=1,\npage_size=10,\nownership_filter=None,\nsort_field=None)
activate Controller

note right of Controller
  Вся логика в контроллере!
  Никакой логики в View
end note

Controller -> Observer: get_k_n_short_list(10, 1)
activate Observer

Observer -> Adapter: get_k_n_short_list(10, 1)
activate Adapter

Adapter -> DB: get_k_n_short_list(10, 1)
activate DB

DB -> Database: SELECT * FROM clients\nLIMIT 10 OFFSET 0
activate Database
Database --> DB: rows[]
deactivate Database

DB --> Adapter: short_list[]
deactivate DB

Adapter --> Observer: short_list[]
deactivate Adapter

Observer --> Controller: short_list[]
deactivate Observer

Controller -> Observer: get_count()
activate Observer
Observer -> Adapter: get_count()
activate Adapter
Adapter -> DB: get_count()
activate DB
DB -> Database: SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM clients
activate Database
Database --> DB: total_count
deactivate Database
DB --> Adapter: total_count
deactivate DB
Adapter --> Observer: total_count
deactivate Adapter
Observer --> Controller: total_count
deactivate Observer

Controller --> FastAPI: {\n  "clients": [...],\n  "current_page": 1,\n  "total_pages": 3,\n  "total_count": 25\n}
deactivate Controller

FastAPI --> View: JSON Response
deactivate FastAPI

View -> View: renderClientsTable(clients)
View -> View: renderPagination(current_page, total_pages)

View --> User: Отображает таблицу\nс клиентами
deactivate View

note over User, Database
  ПАТТЕРН НАБЛЮДАТЕЛЬ: RepositoryObserver готов\n
  уведомить View при изменениях
end note

@enduml